  "status": "PUBLISHED",
  "pattern": "sliding-log",
  "statement": "An API gateway allows each client at most limit accepted requests in any window-second span. A request from client at time t is accepted if fewer than limit of that client's previously accepted requests have times greater than t - window; otherwise it is rejected and not counted. Requests arrive in non-decreasing time order as [client, time]. Return true or false for each request, in order.",
